  "reasoning": "The defendant received large sums of money in exchange for using his influence to obtain project contracts, land and mining rights, and to assist his relative, which constitutes multiple instances of receiving bribes (受贿). He also paid bribes to officials (100 万) and, through his company, gave a bribe on behalf of the unit (35 万), which are acts of personal bribery (行贿) and unit bribery (单位行贿) respectively. No other distinct crimes are indicated. Therefore the appropriate charges are 受贿, 行贿, and 单位行贿.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]受贿;行贿;单位行贿<eoa>"
